5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to understand the physical reality of the parking area before we change the rules.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. I want to see the financial side of things and what the alternatives cost.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I suspect the current allocation is stagnant. I'll look into the history of the spaces.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'm more concerned about the social atmosphere. I want to see how previous disputes were handled.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I want to know how much work it actually takes to manage these things!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I'll check the rain exposure and the morning departures to see the actual flow.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I'll look at the building account's two-year ledger and the ward cycle park by the station.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I'll check the five years of association minutes and the sticker register.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I'll look at the account from the neighbouring block's secretary and last year's complaint log.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,I'll check the treasurer's handover file and the trial of the supplier's display frame.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
