25,2,,status,Ryuji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
26,2,,status,Mio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
27,2,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
28,2,,status,George,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
29,2,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
30,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"It's a mess. Some bikes get soaked in rain, and people are constantly shifting others' bikes to get out.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The building has almost no funds for capital work, and the ward park is quite expensive with a long waitlist.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,George,,The same people have held the best spots for years without any review. Some flats have three bikes!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Complaints about leaning bikes are common but ignored. Also, charging fees in the next block caused some residents to stop attending meetings.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Managing cash is already a chore for the treasurer, and those fancy new racks require physical maintenance and effort.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@George, if some flats have three bikes while others have none, that explains the congestion.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, if the treasurer is already burdened, adding more billing would be a problem.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,George,,Exactly. The lack of review in the minutes shows we've just been ignoring the unfairness.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, that's why I'm wary of fees. It can create a divide and make people resentful.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, if the morning rush is that bad, we need a solution that doesn't just add more paperwork.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"We need a system that addresses the ""best"" and ""worst"" spots fairly.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Since the ward park is full and expensive, we have to solve this internally.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,George,,The daily riders are actually willing to pay if it means they get a guaranteed spot.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,But we must avoid a system that turns neighbors into strangers or enemies.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Mio,,I'm worried that any complex system will just collapse once the initial excitement wears off.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
