55,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Option B would stop the ""best spot"" hoarding, but I worry about the physical effort of double-tier racks.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Option A provides income, but the building account is already lean and the treasurer is busy.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,George,,Option C is the fairest way to break the years of stagnation I found in the minutes.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option A is too risky socially. I've seen it alienate people in the neighboring block.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Mio,,Option B sounds like a maintenance nightmare with those lift springs needing grease.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, if B is too much work, then C is better for the physical layout.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, if A is socially risky and the treasurer is overwhelmed, A is out for me.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,George,,"@Asuka, a lottery ensures no one feels targeted or privileged for too long.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,I prefer C. It's a clean break every year and doesn't involve money.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Mio,,I agree. C requires the least amount of ongoing monthly administration.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I'll vote for C. It solves the hoarding issue without the maintenance of B.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,C is the most stable choice given our financial and administrative constraints.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,George,,I'm voting for C to ensure everyone gets a fair shot at the dry spots.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,C is the safest for the community spirit. I'm in.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Mio,,"I'm voting C. No monthly billing, no greasing racks.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
